/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Hi everyone. Our warm weather has arrived as the busy winter skies have slowly faded. But our cosmos always has fun things to see. In this edition, like all our newsletters, we post a list of visible objects in our local night skies. Copy that list and use it the next time you are out with your scope. )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
