303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Speaking of going out with your scope. TIP: Actually, two tips...make a list of everything you will need to take with you. Batteries, cables, flashlights etc. Before leaving home, check that you have not forgotten something. 2nd tip, astronomy stuff; it can end up everywhere, back seat of the car, truck, garage, back porch, TRY to keep all your gear in one location. Hours of searching will be reduced. )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
