/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We will continue our star parties this summer. Currently no lectures are planned for June, July or August.  As with every event we have; star parties, lectures, workshops, field trips, we absolutely need you to register at: PAS Event Calendar and Registration Site     )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
